  "content": "\n\n<h1>资金，现已实现自动化！</h1>\n<p><em><strong>由 Untitled Modding Cooperation 制作</strong></em></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fcreate-trading-floor%252fguide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/cakeGit/Create-Trading-Floor/blob/1.20.1/shelf/tradingfloor_banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage 横幅\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7DvmP0f2wXE&ab_channel=SomeGuyCalledCak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">观看演示！</a></h2>\n<p>简单来说，<strong>添加了交易仓库方块</strong>，可在 Create 模组中使用，用于在白天自动与村民进行交易。该方块具备完整功能，支持护目镜、显示链接、传送带、漏斗和过滤器等组件。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4635c03eeffbe7da1c221f98494c34db2a3039e6.png\" alt=\"村民使用仓库进行交易\"></p>",
